## Current Behavior
Standard faction-based economy and social structure inherited from WoW. Capitalistic reward systems, hierarchical faction standings.

## Intended Behavior
Replace capitalist-style mechanics with rebellious attitudes and new freedom of affairs. This issue is a placeholder that will be updated naturally as other systems develop and inspiration data becomes available.

## Initial Concepts

### What We're Moving Away From
- "Grind for gold" mentality
- Hierarchical faction standings that gate content
- Competitive resource accumulation
- "Everyone's depressed in the summers" - seasonal burnout from endless progression

### What We're Moving Toward
- Community-oriented reward structures
- Rebellious attitudes toward imposed structures
- Freedom of affairs - player agency over faction dictates
- Organic social dynamics instead of forced competition

